"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 MESSAGE' Real life example: 'Gorilla "
"123456 +1234567890 Hello'"
msgstr ""
"Cov neeg uas ntseeg siab tuaj yeem xa SMS xa mus. TOTP yog qhov yuav tsum "
"tau ua rau qhov no ua haujlwm. Ntxiv cov neeg hauv qab no thiab teeb tsa "
"lawv cov kab lus zais cia. Piv txwv template: 'SECRET TOTP +1234567890 "
"MESSAGE' Lub neej tiag tiag piv txwv: 'Gorilla 123456 +1234567890 Nyob zoo'"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:163
